response:
The incident involves threat actor UAC-0057 (GhostWriter) deploying PicassoLoader via a malicious PowerPoint presentation (daewdfq342r.ppt) masquerading with the emblem of the National Defence University of Ukraine. PicassoLoader loads a .NET dropper which decrypts and runs PhotoMetadataHandler.dll to execute Cobalt Strike Beacon. Network infrastructure is hosted behind Cloudflare and in the Russian Federation.

